  "code": "def parse_port(text: str) -> int:
    if not text:
        raise ValueError("Input must be nonempty")

    # Check for ASCII decimal digits only
    for ch in text:
        if ch < '0' or ch > '9':
            raise ValueError("Only ASCII decimal digits are allowed")

    # Convert to integer
    try:
        value = int(text)
    except ValueError:
        raise ValueError("Invalid integer")

    # Check range: 1 to 65535 inclusive
    if value < 1 or value > 65535:
        raise ValueError("Port must be between 1 and 65535")

    return value",
  "summary": "定义了一个解析端口号的函数，仅接受非空ASCII十进制数字，范围1-65535，允许前导零，拒绝空白、符号、Unicode数字及越界值，否则抛出ValueError。"
